description: Keep repository text in English outside the Chinese README and locale resources
alwaysApply: true
---

# Repository language

- Write documentation, comments, identifiers, templates and CLI messages in English.
- Keep Chinese text only in `README.zh-CN.md`, `src/lazyfish/web/static/i18n-zh.js`
  and `src/lazyfish/locales/zh.py`.
- Keep English and Chinese UI strings synchronized when changing user-facing behavior.
- Retain Unicode input, path and locale regression coverage using escaped fixtures.
- Preserve backward compatibility for already saved localized reports.
